            "Not sure"
          ],
          "maxSelectedChoices": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "radiogroup",
          "name": "fairest_funding_approach",
          "title": "Which funding approach feels fairest to you?",
          "choices": [
            "Everyone pays something based on wages",
            "Employers should pay most of the cost",
            "State government should cover most of the cost from existing revenue",
            "Individuals should keep buying private coverage",
            "A mixed approach",
            "Not sure"
          ]
        }
      ]
